  "details": "Deprecate VRC Station completely, and expose the atomized functions of a VRCStation.\n\nLet UGC handle \"making a chair\" and the other stuff that are currently \"VRCStation janks\":\n\n1. Expose player Transform parenting. (Also allows standing on moving platforms etc, rather than exploiting a \"chair\" and have a janky implementation)\n\n2. Expose player avatar animator parameters in Udon. (Also allows proper MMD functions without exploiting a \"chair with hacked SDK .dll\")\n\n3. (Optional) Expose player visibility in Udon. (No more desync station bug exploit jank using a \"chair\" to hide a player)\n\n... have I missed any janks?",
